DialogueLibrary: {
	Tinkerer: {
		ExplosiveArchitecture_Greeting: {
			Line1.Text: Salutations, [speakerName:player]! I would like to thank you once again for freeing me from my tribe.
			Line2.Text: The goblins aren't fond of technology.[] Their archaic mindset is the reason they even got into the Assailants' cult!
			Line3.Text: Gah![] Anyways.[] I had a brilliant idea for a new invention;[] the W.A.L.L Bomb!
			Line4.Text: Or it's full scientific name, the Wave-Actuated Lattice Layering device![] here's the gist:
			Line5.Text: A radial detonation propagates an architectural wave through the surrounding space...
			Line6.Text: ...which rapidly constructs walls along its path!
			Line7.Text: In layman's terms:[] you press the button,[] and suddenly there are walls everywhere.
			Line8.Text: I've given you a list of equipment and resources you need to gather.[] Gather those and bring them to me promptly![] I'll see to it you get the first prototype!
		}

		ExplosiveArchitecture_TaskSet1Complete: {
			Line1.Text: Ah, yes! The base materials have been gathered.[] All we need now is walls.
			Line2.Text: Would you mind crafting about 50 Wood Walls?
		}
	}
}
